  "fullDescription": "Create breathtaking nature and forest scenes in seconds with this ultimate brush collection for Procreate!\nThe Forest 350 Brush Set includes over 350 high-quality brushes inspired by real trees, leaves, vines, and forest textures — carefully designed for digital artists, illustrators, and nature art lovers.\n\n✨ What’s Inside:\n\n🌲 121 Trees – from tall pines to blooming oaks\n\n🍃 85 Leaves – realistic, outline, and artistic styles\n\n🌿 14 Vines – perfect for jungle or garden effects\n\n🌾 17 Grasses – fine details for natural ground texture\n\n🌳 25 Tree Groups – layered forest clusters\n\n🌲 28 Bare Trees – winter and moody silhouettes\n\n🌴 27 Branches – perfect for detail work\n\n🍂 29 Leaves & Bark Patterns – rich texture brushes\n\n🎨 4 Watercolor Brushes + 2 Color Blenders\n\n🖌️ Features:\n\nExclusive for Procreate (iPad + Apple Pencil)\n\nOutline + Full Color versions\n\nSmooth blending and realistic texture\n\nSemi-transparent brushes for layering effects\n\nOrganized and easy-to-navigate brush library\n\nPerfect for botanical art, fantasy landscapes, illustration & design\n\n💡 Use It For:\n\nNature & forest illustrations\n\nLandscape backgrounds\n\nFantasy worlds & fairytale scenes\n\nChildren’s books & concept art\n\nBotanical patterns & posters\n\nWatercolor and mixed-media digital paintings\nGreat for Pattern Surface designs.\n\n⚙️ Compatibility:\n\nWorks with Procreate 5 and above\n\nRequires iPad + Apple Pencil\n(Not compatible with Photoshop or Illustrator)\n\n📦 You’ll Get:\n\n1 ZIP file with 350+ Procreate brushes and image SUNSET for practicing and 4 watercolor brushes and 2 blenders\n\n💚 Why Artists Love It:\n\n“This set makes forest art effortless — every tree and leaf looks alive!”\n“Beautiful organic shapes, perfect for fast sketching or professional digital art.”\n\n🪴 Commercial License Included\n\nUse the brushes to create and sell your own artworks, prints, products, and designs.\nRedistribution of the brush files themselves is not allowed.",
